        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    prices = [150, 152, 151, 153, 155, 154, 156, 158, 157, 160,\n              162, 161, 163, 162, 164, 165, 167, 168, 166, 169,\n              170, 172]\n    period = 20\n    smoothing = 2\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    multiplier = smoothing / (period + 1)\n    ema = sum(prices[:period]) / period\n\n    for price in prices[period:]:\n        ema = (price - ema) * multiplier + ema\n\n    answer = round(ema, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
